      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由于}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\pi(1+x^{2})}\\big{|}dx=2\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}\\frac{x}{\\pi(1+x^{2})}\\,dx=\\tan x\\big{|}_{0}^{+\\infty}=+\\infty,\\,\\\\&amp;\\text{故若密度函数为}\\varphi_{4}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\pi(1+x^{2})}\\,,\\text{则数学期望是不存在的.从而其方差也不存在.}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由于}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\pi(1+x^{2})}\\big{|}dx=2\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}\\frac{x}{\\pi(1+x^{2})}\\,dx=\\tan x\\big{|}_{0}^{+\\infty}=+\\infty,\\,\\\\&amp;\\text{故若密度函数为}\\varphi_{4}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\pi(1+x^{2})}\\,,\\text{则数学期望是不存在的.从而其方差也不存在.}\\end{aligned}</div>"
