      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}E(X) &amp;= \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x \\frac{1}{\\theta} e^{-x/\\theta} dx = -x e^{-x/\\theta} \\big|_{0}^{+\\infty} + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} e^{-x/\\theta} dx = \\theta, \\\\E(X^2) &amp;= \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x^2 f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x^2 \\frac{1}{\\theta} e^{-x/\\theta} dx = -x^2 e^{-x/\\theta} \\big|_{0}^{+\\infty} + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} 2x e^{-x/\\theta} dx = 2\\theta^2, \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}E(X) &amp;= \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x \\frac{1}{\\theta} e^{-x/\\theta} dx = -x e^{-x/\\theta} \\big|_{0}^{+\\infty} + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} e^{-x/\\theta} dx = \\theta, \\\\E(X^2) &amp;= \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x^2 f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x^2 \\frac{1}{\\theta} e^{-x/\\theta} dx = -x^2 e^{-x/\\theta} \\big|_{0}^{+\\infty} + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} 2x e^{-x/\\theta} dx = 2\\theta^2, \\end{aligned}</div>"
