      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由题意知，}X=0,1,2,\\text{且}P\\{X=0\\}=\\frac{C_5^3}{C_7^3}=\\frac{2}{7},\\\\&amp;P\\{X=1\\}=\\frac{C_5^3C_1^1}{C_7^3}=\\frac{4}{7},\\qquad P\\{X=2\\}=\\frac{C_5^1C_2^2}{C_7^3}=\\frac{1}{7},\\\\&amp;\\text{故}E(X)=0\\times\\frac{2}{7}+1\\times\\frac{4}{7}+2\\times\\frac{1}{7}=\\frac{6}{7},\\\\&amp;E(X^6)=0^2\\times\\frac{2}{7}+1^2\\times\\frac{4}{7}+2^2\\times\\frac{1}{7}=\\frac{8}{7},\\\\&amp;\\text{故}D(X)=E(X^6)-[E(X)]^2=\\frac{20}{49}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由题意知，}X=0,1,2,\\text{且}P\\{X=0\\}=\\frac{C_5^3}{C_7^3}=\\frac{2}{7},\\\\&amp;P\\{X=1\\}=\\frac{C_5^3C_1^1}{C_7^3}=\\frac{4}{7},\\qquad P\\{X=2\\}=\\frac{C_5^1C_2^2}{C_7^3}=\\frac{1}{7},\\\\&amp;\\text{故}E(X)=0\\times\\frac{2}{7}+1\\times\\frac{4}{7}+2\\times\\frac{1}{7}=\\frac{6}{7},\\\\&amp;E(X^6)=0^2\\times\\frac{2}{7}+1^2\\times\\frac{4}{7}+2^2\\times\\frac{1}{7}=\\frac{8}{7},\\\\&amp;\\text{故}D(X)=E(X^6)-[E(X)]^2=\\frac{20}{49}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
